      <title>Google Cloud 推出面向 AI 编码代理的开发者插件</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260910/Google-Cloud-%E6%8E%A8%E5%87%BA%E9%9D%A2%E5%90%91-AI-%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6/</link>
